# Unit surfaces that are also a noun the indefinite article "en" takes, so
# "en <word>" names that noun and not a count of one unit.
# "timer" is the plural of "time" (hour) and also the common-gender loan noun
# "timer" (a device), with the definite form "timeren" and the plural
# "timere": Wiktionary, da "timer" (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/timer).
timer
